name: sim.getObjectSizeValues
description: 
luaSynopsis: float[3] sizeValues=sim.getObjectSizeValues(int objectHandle)
inputs (possibly taken/adapted from C-function counterpart. Adjust accordingly):
1. objectHandle: handle of the scene object
outputs (possibly taken/adapted from C-function counterpart. Adjust accordingly):
1. -1 in case of an error
2. sizeValues : a pointer to 3 size values (x, y and z)
